OL,3,GNEWSA53 more names given over Stanley  
OL,4,APark murder victim                     
OL,6,FPolice have received 53 more possible  
OL,7,Fnames for a woman found dead in a      
OL,8,FLiverpool park after releasing a       
OL,9,Freconstruction of her face.            
OL,11,FHer body was found in a black bin bag  
OL,12,Fin Stanley Park in Anfield on 28 August
OL,13,F2026, prompting a murder investigation.
OL,15,FMerseyside Police said it had received 
OL,16,F128 further pieces of information since
OL,17,Fthe image was released on 13 November  
OL,18,F2026.                                  
